Subject: Cantor M2B Post Supplied Digest Reconciliation Architecture Review

Description: Between-slice review after pure supplied digest reconciliation. It finds that the existing quiescent_double_inventory receipt vocabulary is stronger than the evidence available from repeated non-atomic inventories, and selects a pure cross-form vocabulary revision before any M2C physical producer or receipt issuer.

@ [reconciliation_authority] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_M2B_Supplied_Ordered_Topology_Inventory_Digest_Reconciliation.sop
@ [reconciliation_proof] C:\Project\Cantor\proofs\Cantor_M2B_Supplied_Ordered_Topology_Inventory_Digest_Reconciliation_Proof.sop
@ [phase3_forms] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Phase3_Strict_Pure_Machine_Forms.sop
